#~ msgid ""
#~ "402 and 403 are the awkward pair:"
#~ " they are exempt from the circuit "
#~ "here, but `KeyPool` still treats them"
#~ " as key-specific and mutes the "
#~ "key that saw them (`_KEY_SPECIFIC_STATUSES`)."
#~ " An unfunded account answering 402 to"
#~ " everything therefore mutes every key, "
#~ "and the resulting `KeyPoolExhausted` carries"
#~ " no HTTP status, is not exempt, "
#~ "and opens the circuit anyway. 403 "
#~ "is deliberately kept out of the "
#~ "auth-escalation set because remote "
#~ "providers overload it for per-request"
#~ " rejections — content policy, region "
#~ "blocks — where the upstream is "
#~ "healthy; see the rationale in "
#~ "`apps/backend/routing/endpoint_health.py`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "402 和 403 是尴尬的一对：它们在这里被熔断器豁免，但 `KeyPool` "
#~ "仍然把它们当作 key 相关的失败，会静默看到它们的那把 "
#~ "key（`_KEY_SPECIFIC_STATUSES`）。于是一个欠费账号对所有请求都答 402 时，每把 "
